{"slug":"513732-koni-juj-motte-jagala","title":"ಕೋಣಿ ಜುಜ್: ಮೊಟ್ಟೆ ಜಗಳ","titleEn":"Koni Juj Motte Jagala","level":"2","description":"","orientation":"landscape","cover":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/513732-koni-juj-motte-jagala/cover.jpg","width":548,"height":549},"audio":null,"provenance":{"source":"https://storyweaver.org.in/en/stories/513732-koni-juj-motte-jagala","license":"CC-BY-4.0","licenseNote":"Fetched from StoryWeaver's public API; the book's own attribution page states 'Released under CC BY 4.0 license' for the story and each illustration. Text is the page HTML with markup removed; illustrations are StoryWeaver's 700–960 px crops, unmodified apart from JPEG re-encoding; audio re-encoded to mono MP3.","storyweaverId":513732,"authors":["Priyadarshini Gogoi"],"illustrators":["Pankaj Saikia"],"translators":["Hema Hebbagodi"],"publisher":"Pratham Books","publishedYear":"2022","donor":"P","originalStory":{"title":"Koni Juj: The Egg Fight"},"copyrightNotice":"'Koni Juj: Motte Jagala' has been published on StoryWeaver by Pratham Books. The development of this book has been supported by P.A.N.I. Foundation. www.prathambooks.org.","attributionLine":"ಕೋಣಿ ಜುಜ್: ಮೊಟ್ಟೆ ಜಗಳ (Kannada), translated by Hema Hebbagodi, based on original story Koni Juj: The Egg Fight, written by Priyadarshini Gogoi, illustrated by Pankaj Saikia, supported by P, published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books, 2022) under a CC BY 4.0 license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in","imageCredits":[{"page":2,"title":"Girl running to her grandmother","illustrator":"Pankaj Saikia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":3,"title":"Grandmother looking at the grandchild","illustrator":"Pankaj Saikia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":4,"title":"Girl holding up an egg while chicken stare at her","illustrator":"Pankaj Saikia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":5,"title":"Girl challenging Rontu to an egg fight","illustrator":"Pankaj Saikia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":6,"title":"Girl and boy in an egg fight","illustrator":"Pankaj Saikia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":7,"title":"Girl loses to boy in the egg fight","illustrator":"Pankaj Saikia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":8,"title":"Girl calling her friend for an egg fight","illustrator":"Pankaj Saikia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":9,"title":"Two girls in an egg fight","illustrator":"Pankaj Saikia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":10,"title":"Girl loses to her friend in the egg fight","illustrator":"Pankaj Saikia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":11,"title":"Girl challenges boy to an egg fight","illustrator":"Pankaj Saikia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":12,"title":"Girl and boy both lose the fight","illustrator":"Pankaj Saikia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":13,"title":"Girl is crying to her grandmother","illustrator":"Pankaj Saikia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":14,"title":"Girl's friends come home with eggs","illustrator":"Pankaj Saikia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"},{"page":15,"title":"Grandmother making egg bhaja for granddaughter and her friends","illustrator":"Pankaj Saikia","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2022"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/513732-koni-juj-motte-jagala/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ರೊಂಗಾಲಿ ಬಿಹು ಹಬ್ಬದ ಮೊದಲ ದಿನ,","ಮಾಮೋನಿ ಹಾಸಿಗೆಯಿಂದ ಕುಣಿಯುತ್ತಲೇ ಎದ್ದಳು."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/513732-koni-juj-motte-jagala/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಇವತ್ತು ಕೋಣಿ ಜುಜ್‌ ಎನಾಯ್ಡಿಯೊ,” ಎಂದು ಕೂಗಿದಳು.","“ನೋಡ್ತಿರು, ಇವತ್ತು ಸಿಕ್ಕಾಪಟ್ಟೆ ಮೊಟ್ಟೆ ಜಗಳ ಆಡ್ತೀನಿ.","ಅದರಲ್ಲಿ ಸುಮಾರು ಮೊಟ್ಟೆ ಒಡೀತಿನಿ. ಆಮೇಲೆ ನಾವು ರುಚಿಯಾದ ಮೊಟ್ಟೆ ಭಾಜ ತಿನ್ನೋಣ!”","*ಅಸ್ಸಾಂನ ಅಹೋಮ್ ಸಮುದಾಯದಲ್ಲಿ ಅಜ್ಜಿ ಅಂದರೆ","ತಾಯಿಯ ತಾಯಿಯನ್ನು ಎನಾಯ್ಡಿಯೊ ಎಂದು ಕರೆಯುತ್ತಾರೆ."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/513732-koni-juj-motte-jagala/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಮಾಮೋನಿ ಹುಷಾರಾಗಿ ತನ್ನ ಮೊಟ್ಟೆಗಳನ್ನು ಆರಿಸಿಕೊಂಡಳು.","“ಒಂದು ದೊಡ್ಡ ಮೊಟ್ಟೆ...”","“ಒಂದು ಚೂಪಾದ ಮೊಟ್ಟೆ...”","“ಒಂದು ಗಟ್ಟಿ ಮೊಟ್ಟೆ.”","ಬೇಗ ಬೇಗ ಕೋಣಿ ಜುಜ್‌ಗೆ ಹೊರಟಳು."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/513732-koni-juj-motte-jagala/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಮೊದಲು ಮಾಮೋನಿ ರೊನ್ತು ಮನೆಗೆ ಹೋದಳು.","“ಓಯ್‌, ರೊನ್ತು! ಬಾರೋ, ಕೋಣಿ ಜುಜ್‌ಗೆ.”"]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/513732-koni-juj-motte-jagala/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಮಾಮೋನಿ ಚೂಪಾದ ಮೊಟ್ಟೆ ತೆಗೆದುಕೊಂಡಳು.","ಟಕ್ !","ಟಕ್!","ಟಕ್!"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/513732-koni-juj-motte-jagala/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಅಯ್ಯೋ! ಮಾಮೋನಿ ಮೊದಲ ಜಗಳ ಸೋತಳು.","ಅವಳ ಮೊಟ್ಟೆ ರೊನ್ತು ಪಾಲಾಯಿತು."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/513732-koni-juj-motte-jagala/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಮುಂದೆ, ಮಾಮೋನಿಗೆ ಸುನ್ಮಿ ಸಿಕ್ಕಳು.","“ಓಯ್‌, ಸುನ್ಮಿ! ಬಾರೇ ಕೋಣಿ ಜುಜ್‌ಗೆ.”"]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/513732-koni-juj-motte-jagala/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಈ ಸಲ ಮಾಮೋನಿ ದೊಡ್ಡ ಮೊಟ್ಟೆ ಎತ್ತಿಕೊಂಡಳು.","ಟಪ್!","ಟಪ್!","ಟಪ್!"]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/513732-koni-juj-motte-jagala/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಪಾಪ ಮಾಮೋನಿ ಎರಡನೇ ಸಲವೂ ಸೋತಳು.","ಅವಳ ದೊಡ್ಡ ಮೊಟ್ಟೆಯೂ ಒಡೆದುಹೋಯ್ತು!","“ಯಾಹೂ! ನಿನ್ನ ಮೊಟ್ಟೆ ಈಗ ನಂದು!” ಸುನ್ಮಿ ಖುಷಿಯಿಂದ ಕೂಗಿದಳು."]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/513732-koni-juj-motte-jagala/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಕೊನೆಗೆ, ಮಾಮೋನಿ ಮನಾಬ್‌ನ ಮನೆಗೆ ಬಂದಳು.","“ಓಯ್‌, ಮನಾಬ್‌! ನನ್ನ ಜೊತೆ ಕೋಣಿ ಜುಜ್‌ ಆಡ್ತೀಯಾ?”","ಈ ಸಲ, ಮಾಮೋನಿ ಗಟ್ಟಿಯಾಗಿದ್ದ ಮೊಟ್ಟೆ ತೆಗೆದುಕೊಂಡಳು."]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/513732-koni-juj-motte-jagala/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಆಆಆಆ!”","ಮೂರನೇ ಸಲ ಅದೃಷ್ಟವಶಾತ್‌ ಮಾಮೋನಿ ಮನಾಬ್‌ನ ಮೊಟ್ಟೆ ಒಡೆದಳು!","ಆದರೆ, ಮಾಮೋನಿ ಮೊಟ್ಟೆ ಕೂಡ ಒಡೆದುಹೋಯಿತು."]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/513732-koni-juj-motte-jagala/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಎನಾಯ್ಡಿಯೊ, ನಾ ಜಗಳದಲ್ಲಿ ಗೆಲ್ಲಲಿಲ್ಲ,","ಎಲ್ಲ ಮೊಟ್ಟೆನೂ ಕಳ್ಕೊಂಡೆ,” ಊಂ ಊಂ.","ಅಮ್ಮಮ್ಮ ಮಾಮೋನಿಯನ್ನ ಅಪ್ಪಿಕೊಂಡಳು."]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/513732-koni-juj-motte-jagala/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಮಾಮೋನಿ, ನೀನು ಪ್ರಯತ್ನ ಮಾಡಿದೆಯಲ್ಲ, ಖುಷಿಪಟ್ಟೆಯಲ್ಲ ಅದು ಮುಖ್ಯ. ನೋಡಿಲ್ಲಿ,","ನಿನ್ನ ಸ್ನೇಹಿತರು ಅವರ ಮೊಟ್ಟೆಗಳನ್ನ ನಿನ್ನ","ಜೊತೆ ಹಂಚಿಕೊಳ್ಳಲು ಬಂದಿದಾರೆ,” ಮುದ್ದಿಸುತ್ತ ಹೇಳಿದಳು ಎನಾಯ್ಡಿಯೊ."]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/513732-koni-juj-motte-jagala/p14.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಆಮೇಲೆ ಎನಾಯ್ಡಿಯೊ ಒಡೆದ ಮೊಟ್ಟೆಗಳಿಂದ ಮಾಮೋನಿ ಮತ್ತವಳ ಸ್ನೇಹಿತರಿಗೆ ಮೊಟ್ಟೆ ಭಾಜ ಮಾಡಿಕೊಟ್ಟಳು.","ಆಹಾ! ಎಷ್ಟು ರುಚಿಯಾದ ಬಿಹು ಊಟ!"]}],"wordCount":199}